Title: Classifier Chain Network for Multi-Label Classification
Version: 0.1.0
Encoding: UTF-8
Date: 2026-05-10
Authors@R: person("First", "Last", email = "you@example.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Who to complain to <yourfault@somewhere.net>
Description: Fits a Classifier Chain Network (CCN) for multi-label binary
    classification. The model jointly learns label dependencies through a
    chain structure and optimizes an Lq norm aggregated cross-entropy loss.
    Provides methods for prediction, model summary, and k-fold
    cross-validation with grid search over hyperparameters.
